=== tng_email 00000000-0000-8ce7-94d1-18948b029452 Mission Briefing — Sector 001
--- chunk 0
title: Mission Briefing — Sector 001 | text: Starfleet Command <command@starfleet.gov> to Jean-Luc Picard <picard@enterprise.starfleet>; cc William Riker <riker@enterprise.starfleet> — Mon 5 Jan 2026 09:00

Labels: Starred, Important, Inbox

Captain Picard,

You are hereby ordered to proceed at maximum warp to the Romulan Neutral
Zone. Investigate reports of unusual subspace activity near outpost 23.

Per General Order 12, you have full discretion. Make it so.

— Admiral Hayes


--- chunk 1
title: Mission Briefing — Sector 001 | text: Jean-Luc Picard <picard@enterprise.starfleet> to William Riker <riker@enterprise.starfleet> — Mon 5 Jan 2026 10:30

Labels: Inbox, Sent

Number One,

Set a course for the Neutral Zone, warp 9. Brief the senior staff at
1400 hours. I want Mr. Data running long-range scans the moment we
cross into the buffer region.

Engage.

— Picard


--- chunk 2
title: Mission Briefing — Sector 001 | text: Geordi La Forge <laforge@enterprise.starfleet> to Jean-Luc Picard <picard@enterprise.starfleet>; cc William Riker <riker@enterprise.starfleet> — Mon 5 Jan 2026 11:15

Labels: Inbox

Captain,

Warp core diagnostics attached. We can sustain warp 9 for approximately
twelve hours before we need to drop out for a coolant cycle. I would
recommend a brief stop at Starbase 173 if the mission allows.

— Geordi

